---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/about.css";
---

<Layout title="Prodbytes - Free assets for your next project.">
  <!-- Top Section: Text + Single Featured Photo -->
  <section class="about-hero-section">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2 class="hero-title">
        <span class="hero-title-highlight">Hey!</span> Thanks for stopping by.
      </h2>

      <div class="site-header">
        <p>
          These are some designs and assets that never saw the light of day, so
          I figured why not throw them on the internet for you all to use
          instead of rotting away in a pile of hard drives. I'll be updating the
          site weekly with new designs (and eventually motion graphics), so make
          sure to check back often. <span class="site-header-emphasis"
            ><br/><br/>Everything is ai-free and created by me in Blender, Figma, or
            Adobe.</span
          > I hope that these can be of use to you in some way, shape, or form. If
          you do end up using something, I'd love to see it! Hit me up here and share
          your work! <br/><br/><i>All the best,<br/>Tim</i>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="featured-photo">
      <img src="/about-photo.jpg" alt="Tim working at his desk" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom Section: 3-Column Behind The Scenes -->
  <section class="behind-the-scenes">
    <h2 class="section-title">A peek into my office.</h2>
    <div class="bts-grid">
      <figure class="bts-card">
        <img src="/photo1.jpg" alt="Tim at work 1" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Where the magic happens.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="bts-card">
        <img src="/photo2.jpg" alt="Tim at work 2" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Spinning wax keeps the creative flowing.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="bts-card">
        <img src="/photo3.jpg" alt="Tim at work 3" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Jackie Hughes. Front and center.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>